OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FAn athlete who continued competing in
OL,7,Fa Hyrox event after soiling herself
OL,8,Fhas apologised and said she will
OL,9,Fwithdraw her victory.
OL,11,FJoanna Wietrzyk offered a "sincere
OL,12,Fapology" for the incident in Beijing
OL,13,Fon Saturday.
OL,15,FWietrzyk said she felt "completely fit
OL,16,Fand healthy" at the start of the race
OL,17,Fand had "no reason to expect any
OL,18,Fillness".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
