FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FDespite this, she suffered from bowel
OL,7,Fincontinence in the middle of the race
OL,8,Fand continued until the end ` winning
OL,9,Fthe contest.
OL,11,FSome athletes have criticised her for
OL,12,Fnot immediately stopping, saying the
OL,13,Ffaecal matter was a biohazard for
OL,14,Fother competitors.
OL,16,FHyrox is an indoor fitness
OL,17,Fcompetition, which sees racers combine
OL,18,Fone-kilometre runs with functional
OL,19,Fworkouts, broken up into eight stages.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
