OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FIt has exploded in popularity in
OL,7,Frecent years, following on the growth
OL,8,Fof other intense combined regimes like
OL,9,FCrossFit exercise regimes that mix
OL,10,Fcardiovascular exercise with strength
OL,11,Ftraining.
OL,13,FHyrox has a culture of pushing to the
OL,14,Fabsolute limit, which some have
OL,15,Fcriticised since Saturday's incident.
OL,17,FWietrzyk said she was "deeply sorry"
OL,18,Fand said she had learned "there is
OL,19,Fmore to life and racing and knowing
OL,20,Fwhen it is right to step away".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FShe added: "On reflection, I have
OL,7,Fdecided to retroactively withdraw from
OL,8,Fthe race and forfeit the points I have
OL,9,Fearned."
OL,11,FHyrox has also apologised for not
OL,12,Fstopping the event when the accident
OL,13,Fhappened and said it was changing its
OL,14,Fprotocols so that it wouldn't happen
OL,15,Fagain.
OL,17,FHyrox co-founder Moritz Furste said
OL,18,Fthe company "did not handle the
OL,19,Fsituation like we should have".
OL,26,@yD@Zxz
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
