FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FWietrzyk also thanked people who had
OL,7,Fsent her kind messages and supported
OL,8,Fher since the accident.
OL,10,FShe said: "It means more to me than I
OL,11,Fcan properly express right now. I will
OL,12,Fbe taking some time to recover,
OL,13,Freflect and look after myself and my
OL,14,Ffamily away from the noise."
OL,16,FAfter the accident, Hyrox warned
OL,17,Fpeople that anyone sending Wietrzyk
OL,18,Fabuse online would be banned from
OL,19,Ffuture events.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
