CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1790353094
OL,3,CHyrox athlete 'deeply sorry' for
OL,4,Ccontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,6,FWietrzyk's Hyrox coach Chris Bayens
OL,7,Fdefended her on Instagram earlier this
OL,8,Fweek, saying: "The physical health and
OL,9,Fperformance of an athlete is my job.
OL,11,F"The mental health of athletes is
OL,12,Fshaped far more by the community
OL,13,Faround them, and right now that
OL,14,Fcommunity should take a hard look at
OL,15,Fitself.
OL,17,F"No one is perfect, not in sport, not
OL,18,Fon social media, not in real life.
OL,19,FWhat happened was extraordinary."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
